<h2>Enrolled</h2>
<p>Second factor on. The secret and the replay floor
(<code>totp_last_counter</code>) live on the user row now; the plugin wrote
the floor when the enrolment code was accepted.</p>

<ul class="status">
{% if passed %}
  <li class="ok">this session passed the factor (<code>totp_at</code> set) -
  <a href="/vault/contents">the vault</a> opens</li>
{% else %}
  <li class="quiet">this session has NOT passed the factor -
  <a href="/vault/contents">the vault</a> will step up to the challenge</li>
{% end %}
{% if codes %}
  <li class="ok">recovery codes, shown once:<br>
  {% for code in codes %}<code>{% code %}</code> {% end %}</li>
{% end %}
</ul>

<form method="post" action="/recovery" class="row">
  <button>Issue 5 recovery codes</button>
  <small>a new set revokes the old one</small>
</form>
<p><small>Sign out, then sign in again to meet the challenge.</small></p>
